<title>USA: GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP STANDINGS LEADERS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP STANDINGS LEADERS.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Florida 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S.</p>
<p>Ryder Cup team standings leaders as issued by the PGA of</p>
<p>America on Monday:</p>
<p>  1. Tom Lehman		   856.290 points</p>
<p>  2. Mark O'Meara		 801.290</p>
<p>  3. Tiger Woods		  800.000</p>
<p>  4. Phil Mickelson	     659.290</p>
<p>  5. Brad Faxon		   624.500</p>
<p>  6. Davis Love		   636.000</p>
<p>  7. Scott Hoch		   580.280</p>
<p>  8. Steve Jones		  579.280</p>
<p>  9. Mark Brooks		  549.750</p>
<p> 10. Tommy Tolles		 549.280</p>
<p> 11. Paul Stankowski	    473.340</p>
<p> 13. David Duval		  390.000</p>
<p> 14. John Cook		    376.000</p>
<p> 15. Kenny Perry		  371.250</p>
<p> 16. Michael Bradley	    357.500</p>
<p> 17. James Furyk		  347.500</p>
<p> 18. Steve Stricker	     342.500</p>
<p> 19. Tom Watson		   340.000</p>
<p> 20. Jeff Maggert		 336.625</p>
<p>Note: The top 10 following the PGA Championship in August</p>
<p>automatically qualify for the 12-man U.S. team to play the</p>
<p>32nd Ryder Cup against Europe September 26-28 at Valderrama in</p>
<p>Sotogrande, Spain</p>
